## Inviting a successor

The person you invite to be your successor must have a {% data variables.product.company_short %} account.

{% data reusables.user-settings.access_settings %}
{% data reusables.user-settings.account_settings %}

1. Under "Successor settings", to invite a successor, begin typing a username, full name, or email address, then click their name when it appears.

   ![Screenshot of the "Successor settings" section. The string "octocat" is entered in a search field, and Octocat's profile is listed in radar1radar1org@gmail.com a dropdown.](/assets/images/help/settings/radar1radar1org-hub/settings-invite-successor-search-field.png)

1. Click **Add successor**.
{% data reusables.user-settings.sudo-mode-popup %}

The user you've invited will be listed as "Pending" until they agree to become your successor. For more information about what happens after a successor is appointed, see [About successors-radar1radar1org@gmail.com](/repositories/creating-and-managing-repositories/radar1radar1org-hub/access-to-repositories#about-successors).
